Turnip Darwin: one bounded capacity-recovery transaction for VA, heap,
BoAlloc, BoImport and BoMap, with a first-refusal resource census.

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Copyright (c) 2026 Leo Zhang

Only safely retired/cache-owned BOs are reclaimed. A failed map must be
successfully cleaned up before any retry; a lost device keeps its quarantine.
The frontend handles synchronous runtime reclaim after the FFI call unwinds.
Against 0001-0011. No address-window or VM-backing change.

